  orderBubbles:
  - Wild mushrooms and salted meat made my husband ill.
  - Poison fills his stomach, while dirty blood leaves him sluggish.
  - He is a resting miller, not a guard on duty.
  - He has no acid illness or throat ulcers.
  - Herbalists prescribe Helleborus niger for swallowed poison.
  - They add Burdock Root to cleanse his blood.
  firstHerbId: herb.blackHellebore
  secondHerbId: herb.burdockRoot
